Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value UNIT (\d+)
Value DESCRIPTION (.*)

Start
  ^set interfaces \S+ (?:unit \d+ )?description\s*$$ -> Error "interface description has no value"
  ^set interfaces ${INTERFACE} unit ${UNIT} description ${DESCRIPTION}$$ -> Record
  ^set interfaces ${INTERFACE} unit ${UNIT}\s+.*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^set interfaces ${INTERFACE} description ${DESCRIPTION}$$ -> Record
  ^set interfaces ${INTERFACE}\s+.*$$ -> Record
